cbf0fb621888596aa14ad5f2349b503e23b1b72d:geometry-core/domain-decoupling/evidence/native-p1-20261016/README.md:5:`CONTENT-MANIFEST.json` maps every original relative evidence path to its SHA-256, byte count and content-addressed archive entry. `raw-evidence.tar.xz` contains the exact original bytes, deduplicated across receipts. `readable/` provides byte-identical copies of the overviews, runners, discovery records and principal summaries. No product binary, full checkout or repeated mutant source tree is included. Native artifacts are represented by their original build commands, fingerprint sidecars, compiler output and recorded hashes; a fresh rebuild remains necessary to execute them.
